  "prefLabel": "Gen 406.17 Peer Review of Manuscripts",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Gen 406.17 Peer Review of Manuscripts.\n\n(a) The licensee shall receive continuing professional education credit for participation in peer review of a manuscript so long as:\n\n(1) The licensee was invited to do so; and\n\n(2) The review is for a manuscript to be published in a scientific journal.\n\n(b) The licensee shall receive one continuing professional education credit hour per manuscript for conducting a peer review of a manuscript for a maximum of 5 per renewal cycle.\n\n(c) Documentation of peer review of manuscripts shall be:\n\n(1) A photocopy of the invitation;\n\n(2) A photocopy of the review as submitted via the online journal review system; and\n\n(3) A photocopy of the letter of thanks for completing the review.\n\nSource. #10687, eff 10-7-14; ss by #13556, eff 4-11-23 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Gen 400); ss by #14338, eff 10-7-25, EXPIRES: 10-7-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/gen400.html"
